      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aWiremill§r\n\nMaybe dreams aren't such a good thing ......\nEndless cables spew from this machine.\nParallel = 32 × piece × coil tier.\nEach level of coil increases the speed by 100%.\nAdditional 15% reduction in time per Coil Tier, multiplication calculus.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Heating Coils (the coil tier matters); Neutronium Frame Boxes; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembler, ZPM\n - 8x Neutronium Frame Box\n - 16x Wiremill UV\n - 8x High Energy Flow Circuit\n - 16x Robot Arm ZPM\n - 16x Conveyor Module ZPM\n - 8x ZPM Circuit\n - 16x Superconductor ZPM 4x Wire\n - 16x Neutronium Dense Plate\n - 4,608 L Molten Iridium",
